# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore — build-output & local-tooling hygiene for the CardDemo Java app
#
# Addresses QA finding F-03 (Filesystem Hygiene): the Maven `target/` build
# output — compiled classes, the Spring Boot fat JAR, and the Surefire /
# Failsafe / JaCoCo / OWASP reports — must never pollute `git status` or be
# accidentally committed by a `git add -A`. Only generated build artifacts and
# local editor / OS files are ignored here; no tracked source is affected.
# This complements the existing `.gitattributes` line-ending policy as the
# repository's single, explicit build-output ignore contract.
#
# NOTE: the retained COBOL / CICS / JCL / BMS assets under legacy/ are tracked
# SOURCE (never build output) and are intentionally NOT ignored. The Maven
# Wrapper (mvnw, mvnw.cmd, .mvn/wrapper/**) is likewise tracked and not ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Maven build output -----------------------------------------------------
target/

# Spring Boot repackage / `java -jar` working manifest emitted at the repo root
# by a local build or run (same build-output hygiene concern as target/). No
# tracked META-INF exists in this repository, so this only ignores the generated
# root artifact and never a source path.
/META-INF/

# --- Compiled Java bytecode -------------------------------------------------
*.class

# --- Log files --------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- IntelliJ IDEA ----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
/out/

# --- Eclipse ----------------------------------------------------------------
.classpath
.project
.settings/
/bin/

# --- NetBeans ---------------------------------------------------------------
/nbproject/
/nbbuild/
/nbdist/
.nb-gradle/

# --- Visual Studio Code -----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
